  "question": {
    "text": "Let $(x+10)^{50}+(x-10)^{50}=\\mathrm{a}_{0}+\\mathrm{a}_{1} x+\\mathrm{a}_{2} x^{2}+\\ldots .+\\mathrm{a}_{50} x^{50}$,\r\n\r\nfor all $x \\in \\mathbf{R} ;$ then $\\frac{\\mathrm{a}_{2}}{\\mathrm{a}_{0}}$ is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "12.5",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "12",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "12.25",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "12.75",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$(x+10)^{50}+(x-10)^{50}$\r\n\r\n$=a_{0}+a_{1} x+a_{2} x^{2}+\\ldots+a_{50} x^{50}$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore \\quad a_{0}+a_{1} x+a_{2} x^{2}+\\ldots+a_{50} x^{50}$\r\n\r\n$=2\\left({ }^{50} C_{0} x^{50}+{ }^{50} C_{2} x^{48} \\cdot 10^{2}+{ }^{50} C_{4} x^{46} \\cdot 10^{4}+\\ldots\\right)$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore \\quad a_{0}=2 \\cdot{ }^{50} C_{50} 10^{50}$\r\n\r\n$\\quad a_{2}=2 \\cdot{ }^{50} C_{2} \\cdot 10^{48}$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore \\quad \\frac{a_{2}}{a_{0}}=\\frac{{ }^{50} C_{2} \\times 10^{48}}{{ }^{50} C_{50} 10^{50}}$\r\n\r\n$=\\frac{50 \\times 49}{2 \\times 100}=\\frac{49}{4}=12.25$"
  }
}